      "effect": "advances",
      "direction": null,
      "quote": "the personal income tax rate is 6 percent of taxable income.",
      "mechanism": "Generates additional state revenue by increasing the personal income tax rate, thereby expanding the pool of money available for public services.",
      "certainty": "likely"
